I am near the window.
The flat's door is lying open.
Suddenly, Anitha knocks on the door.
She comes into the room.
There is a nice smile on her face.
There is a small plant in Anitha's hand.
It is a beautiful green plant.
"Welcome to the new home, Maya," Anitha says.
She comes near my desk.
She puts that plant on the windowsill.
Now that plant sits near the desk.
That plant looks very beautiful in the room.
"Thank you very much, Anitha," I say happily.
My laptop sits on top of the desk.
One of my bags lies under the desk.
Anitha looks at the laptop.
"How is Maya's new job?" she asks.
"Work is going very well," I reply.
The nice January breeze is coming in the room.
